    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这个周末你想出去走走吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "想。我最近一直在杭州，还没去过附近的小地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那我们可以去一个水乡看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "远吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不远，坐火车一个多小时。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那很适合周末。要住一晚吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我觉得住一晚会轻松一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样不用当天赶回来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对。周六上午出发，周日下午回来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我喜欢这个安排。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们先看看车票和住的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不用选太贵的，干净方便就行。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我也是这么想的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "到了以后先吃午饭还是先逛？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "看时间吧，不用安排得太满。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我这次想慢一点儿旅行。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那就少去几个地方，多走走看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "决定了，周末去水乡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk2_sc031_word_001.m4a",
